name: Bounded research task or independent review
description: Request a concrete research task, independent audit, or reproducible follow-up.
title: "Research task: "
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: >-
        Use this form for issue-based task claims and independent review requests.
        Discussions are disabled. An issue does not
        reserve a theorem or make a claim canonical.
  - type: textarea
    id: identifiers
    attributes:
      label: Task ID, scope ID and expiry
      description: Paste selector markers; keep expiry within seven days and update this field when renewing.
      value: |
        E99-TASK-ID: <catalogue ID>
        E99-SCOPE-ID: <scope_key>
        E99-CLAIM-EXPIRES: <UTC ISO timestamp>
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: input
    id: review_head
    attributes:
      label: Independent review commit
      description: For an audit request, give the exact PR head SHA and requested review scope.
  - type: textarea
    id: question
    attributes:
      label: Exact question
      description: State the mathematical statement, object, or failure to investigate.
      placeholder: Include hypotheses and the exact expected conclusion.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: input
    id: authority
    attributes:
      label: Base commit and state version
      description: Record the current main commit and docs/state/theorem-state.yaml version.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: dependencies
    attributes:
      label: Canonical dependencies and predecessors
      description: Give theorem IDs and paths; link the closest open PRs or earlier reports.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: scope
    attributes:
      label: Scope and method
      description: Identify the object, hypotheses, changed assumption, method, and bounded domain.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: overlap
    attributes:
      label: Overlap check
      description: Summarize relevant open PRs, discussions, and predecessor work. Explain any intentional overlap.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: evidence
    attributes:
      label: Expected evidence and stopping condition
      description: State what would count as success or falsification, how it can be reproduced, and when to hand off.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: dropdown
    id: class
    attributes:
      label: Work type
      options:
        - Proof or missing-lemma work
        - Independent mathematical audit
        - Exact computation or counterexample search
        - Literature investigation
        - Formalization or verification
        - Repository tooling or documentation
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: claim_status
    attributes:
      label: Expected result status
      description: Indicate whether this is exploratory, a candidate, a regression, or a promotion request. Promotion is reviewed separately.
      value: Exploratory; no canonical theorem change is implied.
    validations:
      required: true
